### 1. Đăng ký
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "password123", "fullName": "Alice" }

### 2. Đăng nhập
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### 3. Xem thông tin từ token (thay <ACCESS_TOKEN>)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

### 4. Refresh (thay <REFRESH_TOKEN>; gọi lần 2 với cùng token sẽ nhận 401)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "<REFRESH_TOKEN>" }

### 5. Logout (cần cả access token trong header và refresh token trong body)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "<REFRESH_TOKEN>" }
